  "id": "cpu-cache-architecture",
  "title": "CPU Cache Architecture",
  "markdown": "\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-fundamentals:visible -->\n\n### Fundamentals\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-lines:visible:parent=sec-cc-fundamentals -->\n\n#### Lines & Blocks\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-hits:visible:parent=sec-cc-fundamentals -->\n\n#### Hits & Misses\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-organization:visible -->\n\n### Organization & Mapping\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-geometry:visible:parent=sec-cc-organization -->\n\n#### Geometry: Size, Lines, Sets & Ways\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-address:visible:parent=sec-cc-organization -->\n\n#### Address Decomposition\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-fields:visible:parent=sec-cc-address -->\n\n##### Tag / Index / Offset\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-placement:visible:parent=sec-cc-organization -->\n\n#### Placement & Associativity\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-direct:visible:parent=sec-cc-placement -->\n\n##### Direct-Mapped\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-set:visible:parent=sec-cc-placement -->\n\n##### Set-Associative\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-fully:visible:parent=sec-cc-placement -->\n\n##### Fully Associative\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-misses-repl:visible -->\n\n### Misses & Replacement\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-miss-types:visible:parent=sec-cc-misses-repl -->\n\n#### Miss Classification\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-cold:visible:parent=sec-cc-miss-types -->\n\n##### Compulsory / Cold Miss\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-capacity:visible:parent=sec-cc-miss-types -->\n\n##### Capacity Miss\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-conflict:visible:parent=sec-cc-miss-types -->\n\n##### Conflict Miss\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-replacement:visible:parent=sec-cc-misses-repl -->\n\n#### Replacement Policies\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-lru:visible:parent=sec-cc-replacement -->\n\n##### LRU\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-plru:visible:parent=sec-cc-replacement -->\n\n##### Pseudo-LRU\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-write:visible -->\n\n### Write Policies\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-write-hit:visible:parent=sec-cc-write -->\n\n#### Write-Through vs Write-Back\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-write-miss:visible:parent=sec-cc-write -->\n\n#### Write-Allocate vs No-Write-Allocate\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-perf:visible -->\n\n### Performance\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-amat:visible:parent=sec-cc-perf -->\n\n#### Average Memory Access Time (AMAT)\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-terms:visible:parent=sec-cc-amat -->\n\n##### Hit Time, Miss Rate & Miss Penalty\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-multi:visible:parent=sec-cc-perf -->\n\n#### Multilevel Design: L1 / L2 / L3\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-cpi:visible:parent=sec-cc-perf -->\n\n#### Memory Stalls & CPI\n\n<!-- nodal-panel:sec-cc-perftrade:visible:parent=sec-cc-perf -->\n\n#### Performance Trade-offs\n\n",
